\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid11815335\charrsid11815335 "Blessed are the confused, for they shall understand that nothing truly makes sense."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid11815335\charrsid11815335 
