\par Jesus scratched His beard.\~}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid11815335\charrsid11815335 "Yes. Or don\rquote t. Either way, they\rquote ll still exist, and you\rquote 
