\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid11815335\charrsid11815335 "Now go forth, question everything, believe what makes you laugh, and don\rquote t take life too seriously\emdash for none of you are getting out of it alive."}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
