\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 1: The Wisdom of the Unknowable}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls14\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 In the beginning, there was nothing. But nothing, dear reader, is a tricky thing. For if there is nothing, then there must be something to know that it is nothing.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}
Seek not to understand, for understanding is but a fleeting dream in a world that cares nothing for dreams.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}The wise man speaks not to reveal the truth, but to acknowledge the lie that truth itself is.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}
Do not ask questions to find answers, for answers are but the dust left behind when the wind of the question passes through.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s37\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 2: The Wisdom of the Fool}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls15\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 The fool is the wisest of us all, for he knows that he knows nothing, and that is all there is to know.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}Laugh, for laughter is the sound of wisdom acknowledging its own absurdity.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}
The fool walks in circles, and in those circles, he finds the path. But he does not know he is walking the path, for he does not care for it. He walks for the sake of walking.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}
When the wise man speaks, the fool listens and laughs, for he knows that even wisdom is just another game of words.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s37\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 3: The Wisdom of Silence}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls16\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 In silence, there is the loudest of truths. For in the absence of noise, one hears the hum of the universe in its infinite contradiction.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}Speak little, for words are like shadows. The more you chase them, the further they run from you.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}
The wise one does not fill the air with empty sounds. He fills it with the space between the sounds, for there lies the real lesson.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}
To be silent is to be free from the tyranny of explanation. In silence, you exist purely, without the burden of making sense.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s37\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 4: The Wisdom of Becoming}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls17\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 You are not who you think you are, but who you are becoming, and that is enough to know. Everything else is illusion.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}
The more you try to define yourself, the more you become a prisoner of your own definitions. You are always in the process of becoming, and that is the only true freedom.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}
Do not worry about where you are going, for there is nowhere to go. The journey is both everything and nothing, all at once.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}
The path to wisdom is like a river: it flows in all directions at once, and you must allow yourself to be carried by it.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s37\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 5: The Wisdom of Acceptance}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls18\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 To accept is to acknowledge that life does not play by your rules, and that is the only rule you need to follow.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}There is no meaning, and that is the meaning. There is no purpose, and that is the purpose.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}
The wise accept the chaos, for in chaos, all things are possible. To fight it is to fight against the inevitable.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}Acceptance is not surrender, it is liberation. In acceptance, you are freed from the need to control.

\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s37\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 6: The Wisdom of the Absurd}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls19\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 The absurdity of life is its greatest wisdom, for it reminds us that nothing makes sense, and in that, everything makes sense.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}
The wise do not seek answers. They seek the questions that have no answers, for in those questions, they find the truest freedom.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}To live in the absurd is to embrace the paradox. To live without expectation is to be fully alive.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}The moment you think you understand, you are lost. Wisdom is found in the moment of not understanding.

\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s37\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 7: The Wisdom of Love}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls20\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 Love is not an answer, but a question that never ends. In loving, you acknowledge the uncertainty of existence.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}To love is to give without expectation, to offer your heart without demanding it be returned.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}
Love is not the opposite of hate. It is the space in which both exist, intertwined in their absurd dance.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}
Love is absurd because it cannot be explained, and that is why it is the truest thing in this world of contradictions.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s37\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 8: The Wisdom of the Self}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls21\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 The self is a mirage, shifting with each passing thought. To seek the self is to chase the horizon.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}
There is no fixed you, only the you that is constantly changing. To be yourself is to be in the process of becoming someone else.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}
To understand yourself is to know that you can never truly understand yourself. Wisdom lies in the acceptance of that fact.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}
The self is not found in what you are, but in what you are not. To know what you are not is to know who you are, fleeting as it may be.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s37\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 9: The Wisdom of Now}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls22\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 The present moment is the only moment that exists, and yet, it slips away before you can grasp it.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}Do not chase the future or dwell in the past. Both are shadows. Only in the now does life exist.

\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}
The wise man lives in the moment, but he does not cling to it. He allows it to pass, for the moment is never the same twice.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}The now is both everything and nothing, and in that, it is perfect.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s37\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 Chapter 10: The Wisdom of Death}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid15616568 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls23\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid15616568 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cf1\insrsid15616568 Death is the final absurdity. It is both the end and the beginning, a mystery that cannot be solved.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}To fear death is to fear life, for death is as much a part of existence as breathing.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}
The wise do not fear death. They welcome it, for it is the great equalizer, reminding us that nothing is permanent.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\lang3072\langfe1033\dbch\af0\langnp3072\insrsid15616568 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}
In death, we are free from the burden of meaning. In death, we are at peace with the absurdity of it all.
