\par And so, the Absurdist smiles, steps back, and whispers:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid9075342 \~}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs35\b\cf1\dbch\af31501\insrsid9075342 \loch\af0\dbch\af31501\hich\f0 \'93\loch\f0 \hich\f0 
