\fs24\lang3072\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3072\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 1.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 
And it came to pass in the land of Bureaucratia, that the rulers decreed the formation of the Department of Government Efficiency, known among the people as DOGE.
\par 2.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 
And they appointed a merchant of electric chariots, whose name was Elon of the House of Musk, to lead DOGE, saying, \'93Thou who hast sent chariots to the heavens, now streamline the affairs of men.\'94
\par 3.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 Elon spake unto the masses, \'93
Behold, I bring tidings of great efficiency. We shall cut the cords of red tape and set the captives of paperwork free.\'94
\par 4.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 
And lo, DOGE did decree that all forms be digitized, yet the scribes lamented, for their quills were made obsolete.
\par 5.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 Then DOGE proclaimed, \'93We shall reduce the multitude of laws,\'94
 and thus combined ten thousand statutes into a single tome, which none could lift.
\par 6.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 And the people marveled, saying, \'93
Truly, we are unburdened, for we can no longer carry the weight of the law.\'94
\par 7.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 
In its quest for transparency, DOGE made all records public, and the citizens rejoiced until they drowned in the flood of information.
\par 8.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 And DOGE saw this and said, \'93We shall create a Department to Interpret the Information,\'94
 and thus another layer was added to the tower of governance.
\par 9.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 
And it was decreed that meetings be held to discuss the reduction of meetings, and these gatherings became as numerous as the stars.
\par 10.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs46\dbch\af31501\insrsid15795442 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15795442 And the prophets of satire lifted their voices, proclaiming, \'93
